<template>
  <section class="wn">
    <header class="wn-heading"><div><p class="wn-kicker">官网内容运营 / 新闻资源包发布</p><h1>一包上传，审核后自动发布。</h1><p class="wn-sub">你负责确认内容，系统负责分类、去重、排期和持续发布。不限每日条数。</p></div><a href="/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="wn-button">查看官网资讯 ↗</a></header>
    <div class="wn-flow"><span><b>01</b> 上传 GPT 新闻包</span><span><b>02</b> 查看分类与校验结果</span><span><b>03</b> 确认后自动发布全部合格新闻</span></div>
    <div v-if="error" class="wn-alert wn-alert-error" role="alert">{{ error }} <button @click="refresh">重新读取</button></div>
    <div class="wn-upload"><div><h2>把今天的 ZIP 新闻包放进来</h2><p>不用手动解压、不用逐篇复制，配图和来源随文章一起导入。</p><small>25MB / 包；支持 Markdown 正文与静态图片。资源限制不是每日发布额度。</small></div><button class="wn-button" @click="copyFormat">复制 GPT 制包要求</button><label class="wn-button wn-primary"><input ref="fileInput" type="file" accept=".zip,application/zip" :disabled="busy" @change="upload">{{ busy ? '正在处理…' : '上传新闻资源包' }}</label></div>
    <div class="wn-health" :class="{ 'wn-warning': !health.running }"><span class="wn-dot"></span><strong>{{ health.message || '正在读取发布服务状态…' }}</strong><span>确认后即使关闭页面，服务器仍继续执行已批准的队列。</span></div>
    <div class="wn-workspace">
      <aside class="wn-packages"><header><h2>我的新闻包</h2><button class="wn-link" @click="refresh" :disabled="busy">刷新</button></header><p v-if="!packages.length && !loading" class="wn-empty">还没有新闻包。上传后，会自动出现在这里。</p>
        <button v-for="item in packages" :key="item.id" class="wn-package" :class="{ active: current?.id === item.id }" @click="select(item.id)" :disabled="busy"><span class="wn-badge">{{ stateLabel(item.state) }}</span><strong>{{ item.title }}</strong><small>{{ item.total }} 篇 · 已发布 {{ item.counts.PUBLISHED || 0 }} 篇</small><small>{{ date(item.createdAt) }}</small></button>
        <div class="wn-pagination"><button :disabled="listPage <= 1 || busy" @click="changeList(-1)">上一页</button><span>{{ listPage }}</span><button :disabled="listPage * 20 >= total || busy" @click="changeList(1)">下一页</button></div>
      </aside>
      <main class="wn-detail">
        <div v-if="loading" class="wn-empty" role="status">正在读取新闻包…</div>
        <template v-else-if="current">
          <header class="wn-detail-head"><div><span class="wn-kicker">本次处理结论</span><h2>{{ current.title }}</h2><p>{{ current.state === 'REVIEW' ? '正文、分类和问题已整理；未经你确认，不会公开。' : '请以实际已发布数量为准，排期成功不等于全部发布完成。' }}</p></div><button class="wn-button" :disabled="busy" @click="exportLedger">导出台账 XLSX</button></header>
          <div class="wn-metrics"><div><small>包内全部</small><b>{{ current.total }}</b></div><div><small>可确认发布</small><b>{{ eligible }}</b></div><div><small>重复 / 问题</small><b>{{ (current.counts.DUPLICATE || 0) + (current.counts.INVALID || 0) }}</b></div><div><small>实际已发布</small><b>{{ current.counts.PUBLISHED || 0 }}</b></div></div>
          <div v-if="current.scheduledEnd" class="wn-alert">已排期 {{ current.counts.SCHEDULED || 0 }} 篇 · 本包末篇预计 {{ date(current.scheduledEnd) }}（北京时间）。服务故障恢复后会继续补发，不丢稿、不重复发。</div>
          <div v-if="current.counts.INVALID" class="wn-alert wn-warning">有 {{ current.counts.INVALID }} 篇未通过文件或内容格式检查，将留在问题列表；不会随确认按钮公开。来源真实性与内容价值仍需你审核。</div>
          <div class="wn-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>发布</th><th>文章 / 摘要</th><th>自动分类</th><th>状态 / 时间</th><th>查看</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="article in articles" :key="article.id"><td><input v-if="article.state === 'READY' && current.state === 'REVIEW'" type="checkbox" :checked="!excluded.includes(article.id)" :aria-label="'发布 ' + article.title" @change="toggleExclude(article.id)" :disabled="busy"><span v-else>—</span></td><td><strong>{{ article.title }}</strong><p>{{ article.summary }}</p><small v-if="article.issue" class="wn-issue">{{ article.issue }}</small></td><td><span class="wn-badge">{{ article.categoryName }}</span></td><td>{{ stateLabel(article.state) }}<small>{{ date(article.publishedAt || article.scheduledAt) }}</small></td><td><button class="wn-link" @click="preview(article)">审核正文</button><a v-if="article.state === 'PUBLISHED'" :href="article.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="wn-link">查看公开页 ↗</a><button v-if="article.state === 'PUBLISHED'" class="wn-link" @click="withdraw(article)">下架</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="wn-pagination"><span>{{ current.total }} 篇 / 第 {{ detailPage }} 页</span><div><button :disabled="detailPage <= 1 || busy" @click="changeDetail(-1)">上一页</button><button :disabled="detailPage * 100 >= current.total || busy" @click="changeDetail(1)">下一页</button></div></div>
          <section v-if="previewed" class="wn-review"><header><h2>{{ previewed.title }}</h2><button class="wn-button" @click="previewed = null">收起正文</button></header><p class="wn-alert">内部审核预览 · {{ previewed.aiAssisted ? 'AI 辅助整理' : '编辑整理' }} · 请核对来源和正文，上传与校验不代表事实已被自动核实。</p><div class="wn-markdown">{{ previewed.body }}</div><h3>来源</h3><p v-for="source in previewed.sources" :key="source.url"><a :href="source.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ source.title }} ↗</a></p></section>
          <footer class="wn-confirm"><div><strong>{{ current.state === 'REVIEW' ? '确认本包，后续交给系统。' : stateLabel(current.state) }}</strong><p>{{ current.state === 'REVIEW' ? '全部合格稿默认选中；可取消个别文章，不需逐条设置时间。' : '可暂停未发布队列，已发布新闻不会因暂停而重复发布。' }}</p></div><div class="wn-controls"><button v-if="current.state === 'REVIEW'" class="wn-button wn-primary" :disabled="busy || !eligible" @click="openConfirm">确认并自动发布 {{ eligible }} 篇</button><button v-if="current.state === 'QUEUED'" class="wn-button" :disabled="busy" @click="control('pause')">暂停未发布队列</button><button v-if="current.state === 'PAUSED'" class="wn-button wn-primary" :disabled="busy" @click="control('resume')">恢复自动发布</button><button v-if="['REVIEW','QUEUED','PAUSED'].includes(current.state)" class="wn-button" :disabled="busy" @click="control('cancel')">取消未发布</button></div></footer>
        </template>
        <div v-else class="wn-empty"><h2>从一个新闻包开始</h2><p>上传成功后，系统将给出总篇数、分类、重复稿和待修复项。</p><p>审核确认后，系统会按默认间隔持续发布，直到本包全部合格新闻发布完。</p></div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <dialog ref="confirmDialog" class="wn-dialog"><form @submit.prevent="confirm"><p class="wn-kicker">整包审核确认</p><h2>确认发布 {{ eligible }} 篇新闻？</h2><p>确认表示你已审核本包被选中的文章及来源。系统随后自动排期，持续发布至完成；不限制每日条数。</p><p>重复稿 {{ current?.counts?.DUPLICATE || 0 }} 篇、问题稿 {{ current?.counts?.INVALID || 0 }} 篇和你排除的 {{ excluded.length }} 篇不会发布。</p><details><summary>发布节奏（已预设，不用每天设置）</summary><label>每篇间隔 <select v-model.number="interval"><option :value="1">1 分钟</option><option :value="3">3 分钟</option><option :value="5">5 分钟</option><option :value="10">10 分钟</option></select></label></details><p v-if="!health.running" class="wn-warning">{{ health.message }}</p><footer><button type="button" class="wn-button" :disabled="busy" @click="$refs.confirmDialog.close()">返回审核</button><button class="wn-button wn-primary" :disabled="busy">{{ busy ? '正在确认…' : '我已审核，确定自动发布' }}</button></footer></form></dialog>
  </section>
</template>

<script setup>
import { computed, onMounted, onBeforeUnmount, ref } from 'vue'
import { websiteNewsApi as api } from '@/modules/platform/api/websiteNews.api'
const packages = ref([]), current = ref(null), articles = ref([]), health = ref({}), error = ref('')
const loading = ref(false), busy = ref(false), excluded = ref([]), previewed = ref(null), interval = ref(3)
const listPage = ref(1), detailPage = ref(1), total = ref(0), fileInput = ref(null), confirmDialog = ref(null)
let alive = true, timer, generation = 0
const eligible = computed(() => Math.max(0, (current.value?.counts?.READY || 0) - excluded.value.length))
const stateLabel = state => ({ REVIEW:'待整包审核', READY:'可发布', INVALID:'待修复', DUPLICATE:'重复跳过', QUEUED:'自动发布中', SCHEDULED:'已排期', PUBLISHED:'已发布', PAUSED:'已暂停', COMPLETE:'发布完成', CANCELLED:'已取消', EXCLUDED:'审核排除', WITHDRAWN:'已下架' }[state] || state)
const date = value => value ? new Intl.DateTimeFormat('zh-CN', { timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hour12:false }).format(new Date(value)) : '—'
function failure(e) { error.value = e?.message || '操作失败，未报告为成功；请刷新后核对。' }
async function refresh() {
  try { const r = await api.list(listPage.value); if (!alive) return; packages.value=r.items;total.value=r.total;health.value=r.health;error.value=''; if(current.value) await readCurrent() } catch(e) { if(alive) failure(e) }
}
async function readCurrent() {
  const id = current.value?.id, token = ++generation
  if (!id) return
  const r=await api.detail(id,detailPage.value)
  if(!alive || token!==generation || current.value?.id!==id) return
  current.value=r.package;articles.value=r.articles;health.value=r.health
}
async function select(id) { if(busy.value) return; current.value={ id };detailPage.value=1;excluded.value=[];previewed.value=null;loading.value=true;try{await readCurrent()}catch(e){current.value=null;articles.value=[];failure(e)}finally{loading.value=false} }
async function upload(event) {
  const file=event.target.files?.[0];if(!file) return
  if(!file.name.toLowerCase().endsWith('.zip') || file.size>25*1024*1024){error.value='请上传不超过25MB的ZIP新闻资源包';event.target.value='';return}
  busy.value=true;error.value=''
  try { const r=await api.upload(file);if(!alive) return;current.value=r.package;detailPage.value=1;excluded.value=[];previewed.value=null;await refresh() }catch(e){failure(e)}finally{busy.value=false;event.target.value=''}
}
async function copyFormat(){try{const r=await api.format();if(navigator.clipboard?.writeText){await navigator.clipboard.writeText(r.prompt);window.alert('已复制，可交给GPT生成符合导入格式的ZIP。')}else{const blob=new Blob([r.prompt],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='GPT新闻包生成要求.txt';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}}catch(e){failure(e)}}
function toggleExclude(id) { excluded.value = excluded.value.includes(id) ? excluded.value.filter(x=>x!==id) : [...excluded.value,id] }
function openConfirm(){confirmDialog.value.showModal()}
async function confirm(){busy.value=true;error.value='';try{await api.confirm(current.value.id,{expectedVersion:current.value.version,reviewDigest:current.value.reviewDigest,confirmed:true,excludedIds:excluded.value,intervalMinutes:interval.value});confirmDialog.value.close();excluded.value=[];await refresh()}catch(e){failure(e);confirmDialog.value.close()}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function control(action){if(action==='cancel' && !window.confirm('取消本包全部未发布新闻？已公开文章不受影响。'))return;busy.value=true;try{await api.control(current.value.id,{action,expectedVersion:current.value.version});await refresh()}catch(e){failure(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function preview(article){try{const id=current.value.id,r=await api.article(article.id);if(alive&&current.value?.id===id)previewed.value=r}catch(e){failure(e)}}
async function withdraw(article){if(!window.confirm(`下架《${article.title}》？公开页面将不可访问。`))return;busy.value=true;try{await api.withdraw(article.id);await refresh()}catch(e){failure(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function exportLedger(){try{const blob=await api.ledger(current.value.id),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=`news-${current.value.id}.xlsx`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}catch(e){failure(e)}}
async function changeList(delta){listPage.value+=delta;await refresh()}
async function changeDetail(delta){detailPage.value+=delta;loading.value=true;try{await readCurrent()}catch(e){current.value=null;articles.value=[];failure(e)}finally{loading.value=false}}
onMounted(async()=>{await refresh();timer=setInterval(()=>{if(!busy.value&&!document.hidden)refresh()},20000)})
onBeforeUnmount(()=>{alive=false;generation++;clearInterval(timer)})
</script>

<style scoped>
.wn{color:#213750;padding:24px;max-width:1600px;margin:auto;font-family:inherit}.wn h1{font-size:30px;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.6px;margin:8px 0 12px}.wn h2{font-size:18px;margin:0}.wn p{line-height:1.8}.wn-kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#6181ac;margin:0}.wn-sub{color:#71839a;font-size:13px;margin:0}.wn-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;align-items:center}.wn-button{font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #d8e3f1;background:#fff;color:#345774;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 15px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:40px}.wn-button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.wn-primary{background:#2464d8;color:#fff;border-color:#2464d8}.wn button:focus-visible,.wn input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7aa8f0;outline-offset:3px}.wn-flow{display:flex;gap:24px;padding:22px 0;color:#6f849f;font-size:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.wn-flow b{font-size:11px;color:#306bd3;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#eaf2ff;margin-right:8px}.wn-upload{background:linear-gradient(115deg,#eef4ff,#fff);border:1px solid #d7e5fa;border-radius:14px;padding:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.wn-upload p{font-size:13px;color:#627b9b;margin:8px 0}.wn-upload small{font-size:11px;color:#8594a8}.wn-upload input{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;clip-path:inset(50%);overflow:hidden}.wn-upload label:focus-within{outline:3px solid #7aa8f0;outline-offset:3px}.wn-health{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:16px 3px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;color:#467f6b}.wn-health strong{font-weight:500}.wn-health>span:last-child{color:#8797ad;margin-left:auto;font-size:11px}.wn-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}.wn-warning{color:#98702d!important}.wn-workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:255px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}.wn-packages{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0e7f0;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.wn-packages>header{padding:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.wn-packages h2{font-size:15px}.wn-package{padding:18px;width:100%;border:0;border-top:1px solid #eef1f6;background:#fff;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.wn-package.active{background:#eff5ff;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #3273de}.wn-package strong{display:block;line-height:1.7;font-size:13px;color:#294667;margin:8px 0}.wn-package small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#8394aa;margin:4px 0}.wn-badge{background:#edf3fc;color:#577cae;border-radius:5px;padding:4px 7px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-flex}.wn-detail{min-width:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0e7f0;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.wn-detail-head{padding:25px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}.wn-detail-head h2{margin:8px 0}.wn-detail-head p{color:#8192a9;font-size:12px;margin:0}.wn-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid #e4ebf4;margin:0 24px 20px;border-radius:10px;background:#fafcff}.wn-metrics>div{padding:16px;border-right:1px solid #e4ebf4}.wn-metrics>div:last-child{border:0}.wn-metrics small{color:#8b9bb0;font-size:11px}.wn-metrics b{display:block;font-size:28px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px;color:#2d5787}.wn-alert{padding:14px 18px;background:#f1f6fe;color:#617c9f;margin:12px 24px;font-size:12px;border-radius:8px;line-height:1.8}.wn-alert-error{margin:10px 0;color:#a64040;background:#fff0f0}.wn-alert button{background:none;border:0;text-decoration:underline;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}.wn-table-wrap{overflow:auto}.wn table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;font-size:12px;min-width:640px}.wn th{background:#f7f9fd;color:#8394ae;font-weight:500;padding:12px 16px;white-space:nowrap}.wn td{padding:17px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf1f6;vertical-align:top;color:#58728e}.wn td:nth-child(2){width:48%}.wn td strong{font-size:13px;color:#2b4769;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7}.wn td p{font-size:11px;color:#8a9cb2;margin:5px 0}.wn td small{font-size:10px;display:block;margin-top:7px;max-width:420px;line-height:1.7}.wn-issue{color:#aa7950}.wn-link{font-size:12px;border:0;background:none;padding:3px 0;color:#3472cd;cursor:pointer;display:block;white-space:nowrap}.wn-pagination{padding:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;color:#8a9ab0;font-size:11px}.wn-pagination button{padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #e0e7f1;background:white;color:#607d9f;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer}.wn-pagination button:disabled{opacity:.45}.wn-pagination>div{display:flex;gap:8px}.wn-confirm{padding:23px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid #e1eaf7;background:#f7faff;position:sticky;bottom:0}.wn-confirm strong{font-size:14px;color:#33577e}.wn-confirm p{font-size:11px;color:#859ab2;margin:5px 0}.wn-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.wn-empty{padding:50px 25px;color:#8b9aaf;line-height:1.9;font-size:13px}.wn-empty h2{color:#4c6e92;margin-bottom:15px}.wn-review{padding:26px;border-top:1px solid #e5ecf5;background:#fcfdff}.wn-review header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}.wn-review .wn-alert{margin:20px 0}.wn-review a{font-size:13px;color:#3371c9}.wn-markdown{white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:15px;line-height:2;color:#425f7d;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.wn-dialog{border:1px solid #dce5f0;border-radius:16px;max-width:570px;width:calc(100vw - 40px);padding:30px;color:#29476b;box-shadow:0 24px 80px #0a203e44}.wn-dialog::backdrop{background:#152c4d77}.wn-dialog h2{font-size:23px;margin:12px 0}.wn-dialog p{font-size:13px;color:#6d839f;line-height:1.9}.wn-dialog details{padding:16px;background:#f4f8fe;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px}.wn-dialog label{display:block;margin-top:15px}.wn-dialog select{padding:7px;border:1px solid #ccdcf2;background:#fff;border-radius:6px}.wn-dialog footer{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;margin-top:25px}@media(max-width:1100px){.wn{padding:18px}.wn-workspace{grid-template-columns:215px minmax(0,1fr)}.wn-confirm{flex-wrap:wrap}.wn-detail-head{padding:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}}@media(max-width:750px){.wn-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.wn h1{font-size:25px}.wn-upload{padding:20px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.wn-workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wn-packages{max-height:290px;overflow:auto}.wn-metrics{margin:0 14px 15px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.wn-metrics>div{border-bottom:1px solid #e4ebf4}.wn-health>span:last-child{margin-left:0}.wn-flow{gap:13px}.wn-dialog{padding:22px}.wn-dialog footer{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
